/T (When designing a scan-data pipeline for evolving enterprise networks, a security analyst must prioritize five core architectural principles: \(1\) Fail-Fast Scope Enforcement to guarantee legal compliance with Rules of Engagement; \(2\) Non-Destructive Quarantine Auditing so anomalous or malformed scanner outputs are flagged rather than silently dropped; \(3\) Composite-Key Relational Integrity across TCP/UDP protocols and scan sessions; \(4\) Deterministic Idempotency & Immutable Versioning so every finding is reproducible during client verification; and \(5\) Vectorized/Indexed Execution to scale cleanly from single-subnet audits to enterprise-wide continuous vulnerability management. )
/E (When designing a scan-data pipeline for evolving enterprise networks, a security analyst must prioritize five core architectural principles: \(1\) Fail-Fast Scope Enforcement to guarantee legal compliance with Rules of Engagement; \(2\) Non-Destructive Quarantine Auditing so anomalous or malformed scanner outputs are flagged rather than silently dropped; \(3\) Composite-Key Relational Integrity across TCP/UDP protocols and scan sessions; \(4\) Deterministic Idempotency & Immutable Versioning so every finding is reproducible during client verification; and \(5\) Vectorized/Indexed Execution to scale cleanly from single-subnet audits to enterprise-wide continuous vulnerability management. )
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [41]
>>
