/Title (Student A generated synthetic benchmark datasets at N = 50 and N = 5,000 host-port records. Student B profiled the baseline pipeline and identified a major bottleneck: row-by-row regex matching inside mutate\(\) and unindexed multi-column joins took 1.42 seconds at 5,000 rows \(and scaled super-linearly\). By pre-compiling PCRE regular expressions \(perl = TRUE\), vectorizing IP octet bitmask checks, and using data.table keyed joins \(setkeyv\), execution time dropped by 83.8% while maintaining 100% output equivalence.)
